vell Q4 and fiscal 2026 results (SEC 8-K)","https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1835632/000183563226000006/q426_8kx1312026ex-991.htm"]]},"video":{"revenueLine":{"cap":"Revenue grew every quarter, reaching $2,219M in Q4, about three-quarters from data center.","say":"Revenue grew every quarter, reaching 2.2 billion dollars in the fourth quarter, about three quarters of it from data center customers."},"spotlights":[{"kicker":"Turnaround","big":"$1,323M","sub":"operating income · from a $720M loss","lines":["Gross margin 51.0%, up 9.7 points","Restructuring charges down to $16M"],"cap":"Operating income swung to $1,323M from a $720M loss.","say":"Operating income swung to 1.3 billion dollars, from a 720 million dollar loss a year earlier."},{"kicker":"One-time gain","big":"$1,830M","sub":"gain on sale of the automotive Ethernet business","lines":["Net income $2,670M","Buybacks $2,040M"],"cap":"A $1,830M gain on selling the automotive Ethernet business lifted net income to $2,670M.","say":"A 1.8 billion dollar gain on selling the automotive Ethernet business lifted net income to 2.7 billion dollars."}]}}